  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0410.neaniskoi.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0410.neaniskoi.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0410.neaniskoi.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0410_neaniskoi"><head>ΝΕΑΝΙΣΚΟΙ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1">
              <head>I.</head>
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1-l1">Ego ante hac si quis nominaret Gorgonas,</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1-l2">figmentum esse arbitrabar: at postquam in forum</l>
                <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1-l3">adveni, actutum credidi: piscarios</l>
                <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1-l4">nam simul inspexi, factus sum ipse saxeus:</l>
                <l n="5" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1-l5">adeoque ego illos, ni prius vultum avertero,</l>
                <l n="6" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1-l6">affari nequeo: nam si inspiciam quantulum</l>
                <l n="7" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1-l7">quanti indicent pisciculum, lapidescam illico.</l>
              </lg>
            </div>
            <pb n="91" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044079388682:scan:101" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1_2">
              <head rend="center">Ι.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1_2-l1">Ἐγὼ τέως μὲν ᾠόμην τὰς Γοργόνας</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1_2-l2">εἶναί τι λογοποίημα, πρὸς ἀγορὰν δ᾽ ὅταν</l>
                  <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1_2-l3">ἔλθω πεπίστευκ᾽· ἐμβλέπων γὰρ αὐτόθι</l>
                  <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1_2-l4">τοῖς ἰχθυοπώλαις, λίθινος εὐθὺς γίγνομαι,</l>
                  <l n="5" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1_2-l5">ὥστ᾽ ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἔστ᾽ ἀποστραφέντι μοι</l>
                  <l n="6" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1_2-l6">λαλεῖν πρὸς αὐτούς; ἂν ἴδω γὰρ ἡλίκον</l>
                  <l n="7" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-1_2-l7">ἰχθὺν ὅσου τιμῶσι πήγνυμαι σαφῶς.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus VI p. 224 c: οἱ γὰρ ἐν Ῥώμῃ ἰχθυοπῶλαι οὐκ ὀλίγον ἀποδέουσι τῶν κατὰ τὴν Ἀττικήν ποτε κωμῳδηθέντων, περὶ ὧν Ἀντιφάνης μὲν ἐν Νεανίσκοις φησίν <quote>Ἐγὼ τέως μὲν κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 3 vulgo πεπίστευκ᾽ εὐθύς· ἐμβλέπων γὰρ αὐτοῖς ἰχθυοπώλαις. Correxit Porsonus ad Toupii Emend. IV p. 501. — Vs. 4 ante Dindorfium γίνομαι et vs. 6 ἐάν.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-2">
              <head>II.</head>
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-2-l1">Divitiae multis sunt integumentum malis,</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-2-l2">o mater, at conspicua et despicabilis</l>
                <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-2-l3">res est paupertas.</l>
              </lg>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-2_2">
              <head rend="center">ΙΙ.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-2_2-l1">Ὁ πλοῦτός ἐστι παρακάλυμμα τῶν κακῶν,</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-2_2-l2">ὦ μῆτερ, ἡ πενία δὲ περιφανές τε καὶ</l>
                  <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0410-neaniskoi-2_2-l3">ταπεινόν.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Stobaeus Floril. XCVII 8 cum lemmate Ἀντιφάνους ἐκ Νεανίσκων.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 2 δὲ addidit Grotius.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>